DESCRIPTION:Pursuant to the Privacy Act of 1974\, notice is hereby given t
 hat VA is modifying a system of records in its inventory titled\, Benefici
 ary Fiduciary Field System (BFFS)-VA (37VA27). This system contains record
 s used for the administration of benefits regarding beneficiaries who VA o
